# One user coding in VS Code: a single slot with the full 32k context (per-slot context = CTX; llama-server runs -c CTX*PARALLEL).
# Measured (benchmarks/reports/P3_CODER_30B_GOP_2_CARD.md): merged Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B, 32k, RTX 5070 52% / RTX 3060 48% ~127 tok/s;
# 54% on the 5070 already collapses. More users => higher PARALLEL, which divides the context between slots.
PARALLEL=1
CTX=32768
